From 873a61459de35568ca554881261b80ea376745c3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dhruv Gupta <dhruv@zetesislabs.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 04:40:42 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Backport soundness fixes to the v4.31 comparator for
 Mathesis

- landrun: terminate its flags before the command (upstream 9badaf470d)
- kernel built-ins Char.ofNat, List, Nat, String, String.mk, Char, optParam,
  autoParam, semiOutParam, outParam must match the kernel's (8c0e44e73c,
  2312244ac7)
- theorem targets reached from the worklist are compared by statement, not
  proof (#64)
- constants reached only through an Expr.proj are collected and compared (#68)
- the quotient constants the replay skips are checked against the kernel's (#71)
- regression tests char_ofnat_issue, proj_trick, quot_mismatch,
  theorem_hole_issue
